   269	
   270	# --- increment 1.4: a dead upstream must not blank the others, and connected-but-empty
   271	# --- is not the same thing as disconnected ---
   272	# All three colloquium brands found this independently: on_list_tools served ZERO tools
   273	# for every upstream when any one was missing, so during an Xcode reconnect Drew's tools
