    57	 
    58	---tool NAME=REPLY declares one tool; calling it returns REPLY as text content.
    59	+--tool NAME=REPLY declares one tool; calling it returns REPLY as text content. Two REPLY
    60	+  prefixes change the behaviour: "env:VAR" answers with os.environ[VAR] resolved at call
